    "created_at": "2015-12-03T15:14:19Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-12-03T15:14:19Z",
    "body": "As I said on blink-dev, I think we should remove the spec for toBlob in its current form entirely, and leave only a promise-returning version. Perhaps with a new name (asBlob? saveToBlob?), to avoid compat issues. It's already weird that toBlob is async whereas toDataURL is sync, so a new name helps with that minor problem anyway.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
