    "updated_at": "2015-12-10T10:55:53Z",
    "body": "I think that https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/391 addressed the main confusion here. Is that sufficient, or is the \"a serialisation of the bitmap as a file\" algorithm also confusing? It's used by both `toDataURL()` and `toBlob()`, so it has an abstract \"file\" concept, which is not the `File` interface. I don't know how to rename it, any ideas? If not, I'll close this issue when the BlobCallback rename has been merged.\n",
